<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 24/25.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 24/25.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>24/25. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	  April 24/25    April 23/24</p>
<p> CZK	0.45084	 0.45022</p>
<p> DKK	2.10015	 2.09989</p>
<p> FIM	2.66225	 2.65158</p>
<p> HUF	0.07593	 0.07597</p>
<p> JPY	0.109	   0.10877</p>
<p> LTL	3.4369	  3.42879</p>
<p> LVL     23.61928	23.57493</p>
<p> RUR	0.00239	 0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.79453	 1.7869</p>
<p> UAH	7.46037	 7.4319</p>
<p> USD     13.7476	 13.71</p>
<p> XEU     15.59596	15.59855</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
